hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"74","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyib (Rahimahullah) se Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Khaibar se wapas hue to raat bhar chale yahan tak ke jab raat ke aakhri hisse mein the to padhao dala, aur Bilal se farmaya: 'Hamare liye Subah [ki namaz] ki hifazat karo.' Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Aap ke sahaba so gaye, aur Bilal ne jitna un ke liye muqaddar tha pahra diya. Phir woh apni sawari se tek laga kar Fajr ki taraf munh kiye baithe the ke un ki aankhen ghalib aa gain aur woh so gaye. To na Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jage aur na qafle mein se koi, yahan tak ke dhoop ne unhen aa liya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghabra kar uthe aur farmaya: 'Ai Bilal, kahan gaya jo tum ne kaha tha?' Bilal ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, meri jaan ko bhi usi ne pakad liya jis ne Aap ki jaan ko pakda. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Koooch karo [yahan se sawariyan aage badhao].' To unhon ne apni sawariyan uthain aur thoda aage badhe. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bilal ko hukm diya to unhon ne namaz ki iqamat kahi, aur Aap ne unhen Subah padhai. Phir jab namaz se farigh hue to farmaya: 'Jo namaz bhool jae to jab use yaad aae use padh le, kyunke Allah farmata hai: ﴿وَأَقِمِ الصَّلَاةَ لِذِكْرِي﴾ [Taha: 14] [Aur Meri yaad ke liye namaz qaim karo].'"
"75","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Aap ke ek safar mein the, to ham Fajr ki namaz se soe reh gaye yahan tak ke suraj nikal aaya. To Aap ne muazzin ko hukm diya to us ne azan kahi, phir ham ne Fajr ki do rak'aten [sunnat] padhin, yahan tak ke jab [farz] namaz hamare liye mumkin hui to ham ne use padha."
